From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: constrain streaming and coherent NPU DMA

Port the PR DMA aperture fix onto the retained upstream coherent mailbox
implementation. Set both masks and constrain allocations to the NPU bus
aperture; the following mailbox patch also verifies each allocated range.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
@@ -29,6 +29,7 @@
  * is 16 bytes (INODE_TXRX_REG_ADDR). Keep headroom for future commands.
  */
 #define AIROHA_NPU_MBOX_SIZE			256
+#define NPU_DMA_ADDR_MAX			0xbfffffffULL
 
 #define REG_NPU_LOCAL_SRAM		0x0
 
@@ -792,7 +793,8 @@
 		npu->irqs[i] = irq;
 	}
 
-	err = dma_set_coherent_mask(dev, DMA_BIT_MASK(32));
+	dev->bus_dma_limit = NPU_DMA_ADDR_MAX;
+	err = dma_set_mask_and_coherent(dev, DMA_BIT_MASK(32));
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
